sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Event page and favorites
    %% Stories: 10, 11, 49, 50, 51, 52, 53, 54
    %% Description: An artist maintains a description and links that appear on the event page; a visitor reads the event page; a user favorites the event or artist and finds them in the profile.
    actor AP as Artist (person)
    actor VI as Visitor
    actor UP as User (person)
    participant U as User
    participant EV as Event
    participant VE as Venue
    participant AR as Artist

    AP->>AR: write description, add links to website, social media and music platforms [50, 51, 52, 54]
    VI->>EV: open event page
    EV->>VE: getLocation()
    EV->>AR: getProfile()
    EV-->>VI: date, location, artist description and links [11, 49]
    opt a logged-in user favorites the event or the artist [53]
        UP->>U: favorite on the event page
        U->>EV: addFavoriteOf(user)
        U->>AR: addFavoriteOf(user)
    end
    UP->>U: open favorites in the profile [10]
    U-->>UP: favorited events and artists
